  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.30 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.49. Background removal and RgbaStats.IsFullyOpaqueAsync work on WebGL again (they used Atomic.Max, which WebGL lacks, since 2026-10-19); the counting uses no atomics on any backend now. A NullReferenceException while GraphExecutor reads a runtime constant back is no longer swallowed (an obsolete workaround). FetchRangeStream.FailedRequests (diagnostics). No other API change.",
